        correctIndex: 1,
        explanation: "Average rate of disappearance $= -\\frac{\\Delta [A]}{\\Delta t} = -\\frac{0.50 - 0.80}{10} = \\frac{0.30}{10} = 0.03\\text{ M s}^{-1}$."
